<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "忍び寄る影.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜サクラ抱き合う.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる電気.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>For several seconds, the air in the room stayed frozen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE>, who was holding her tight, trembled in small shudders.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was trying to protect me, and he made himself my shield..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mo... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Please turn off the light...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s voice brought me back to my senses, and I hurriedly turned off the light in the room.
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ頭抱える2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ugh-ngh-ngh-ngh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same moment, <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> began <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="もだ">writhing</STYLE> in agony.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Hang in there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Get away, quick...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　This place is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">dangerous...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're coming too...! Hurry, get up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> pulled <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> by the arm and got her to her feet.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Let's get out of here together!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Everyone's coming after us!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　With crazy speed and strength...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Crazy speed and strength...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were strong enough that even <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>, athletic as she was, would put it that way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It can't be...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I ran to the window and pulled off the wooden board.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And when I looked down...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
