{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\死神取り囲み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "明かされた真実.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
About 20 strange figures in red robes, holding <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="なた">nata</STYLE> and maces.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They had this house surrounded on every side.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's with those outfits...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
