{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "300" "30"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
One of them leapt all the way up to this second floor and broke into the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was right. They're using Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They used Droga so they could take on <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> and her athleticism...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\三畳間割れる電気.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\死神まぶしい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, the light in the room came on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The figure seemed dazzled by the sudden light and threw one hand over its eyes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hyah!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n960\r\n100\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
