{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Now's our chance, let's get out of here, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> had blinded the figure and attacked in that opening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she had hit a vital spot such as the medulla, because the figure was staggering.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> pulled me and <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> by the hand, and we were led out of the room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\新村本家2階廊下暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! What are those!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hah... hah... th-those outfits are the shinigami </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="そう">garb</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The formal dress of the Arata settlement, for memorial services and for battle."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What do you mean, shinigami <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="そう">garb</STYLE>! And where are we supposed to run to!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When there are as many as 20 of those things...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I followed the two of them along the dark hallway and went down the stairs.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\たいまつの明かり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
