{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Deep down the hallway that should have been dark―
{PAUSE ""}
light was showing from the direction of the entrance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wasn't electric light.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\死神たいまつ1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
