{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"............!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Two shinigami, holding torches―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they came at us with the same force as before, we wouldn't stand a chance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pushed <STYLE ID="1">Sakura-san</STYLE> and her daughter aside, removed the <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="サプレッサー">silencer</STYLE>, and raised the gun.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\銃を構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\桃子銃.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "200" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Get out of the way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Droga or not, there's no way they can take a bullet and be fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come on, get out of the way! Or else I really will...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\死神たいまつ1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
