{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But the two shinigami kept walking toward us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What do I do...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I don't shoot, they'll get me...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I don't shoot, they'll kill me...!<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Aaaaah!!"</STYLE><PG>
